{"version":1,"key":"quest:144","content":{"id":144,"title":"pnpm.overrides 的作用是什么？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:144","type":"quest","id":144},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"pnpm overrides 强制指定依赖版本","meta":"","excerpt":"考虑这样一个场景：你依赖了 A，而 A 依赖了 B。突然 B 被发现存在 bug 或者安全隐患，需要升级。但是 B 不是你直接依赖的，你只能等待 A 的维护者发布新版，这其中的等待时间完全不可控。所以如果能有一种方式直接修改 B 的版本就好了。 pnpm.overrides 就可以来解决这个问题，它可以用来直接指定依赖","target":{"key":"card:694","type":"card","id":694},"citeKey":"card:694"}],"trail":[{"time":1770835048680,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1775542608765,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1775542608779,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1770835048680,"updateTime":1770835048680,"resolvedTime":1775542608779},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1770835048680}}